{"ticker":"MDLZ","updated":"2026-10-23T23:17:12Z","profile":{"longName":"Mondelez International, Inc.","shortName":"Mondelez International, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Confectioners","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mondelezinternational.com","fullTimeEmployees":91000,"marketCap":81428455424,"trailingPE":23.455881,"forwardPE":18.994257,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.052387,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":69.09091,"targetHighPrice":77.0,"targetLowPrice":55.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.041,"earningsGrowth":1.449,"grossMargins":0.31146,"operatingMargins":0.21978001,"profitMargins":0.08862001,"totalRevenue":39674998784,"beta":0.391,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":66.65,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":51.2,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.19},"summary":"Mondelez International, Inc., through its subsidiaries, manufactures, markets, and sells snack food and beverage products in Latin America, North America, Asia, the Middle East, Africa, and Europe. The company provides biscuits and baked snacks, including cookies, crackers, salted snacks, snack bars, and cakes and pastries; chocolates; and gums and candies, as well as various cheese, grocery, and powdered beverage products. Its brand portfolio includes Oreo, Ritz, LU, CLIF Bar, Tate's Bake Shop biscuits and baked snacks, Cadbury Dairy Milk, Milka, and Toblerone chocolate. It serves supermarket chains, wholesalers, supercenters, club stores, mass merchandisers, distributors, convenience stores, gasoline stations, drug stores, value stores, and other retail food outlets through direct store delivery, company-owned and satellite warehouses, distribution centers, third-party distributors, and other facilities, as well as through independent sales offices and agents. The company also sells products directly to businesses and consumers through e-retail platforms, retailer digital platforms, as well as through its direct-to-consumer websites and social media platforms. Mondelez International, Inc. was formerly known as Kraft Foods Inc. and changed its name to Mondelez International, Inc. in October 2012. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","summary_zh":"Mondelez International, Inc. 透過其子公司在拉丁美洲、北美、亞洲、中東、非洲和歐洲生產、行銷和銷售休閒食品和飲料產品。該公司提供餅乾和烘焙零食，包括餅乾、薄脆餅乾、鹹味零食、小吃棒以及蛋糕和糕點；巧克力；口香糖和糖果，以及各種起司、雜貨和粉狀飲料產品。其品牌組合包括 Oreo、Ritz、LU、CLIF Bar、Tate's Bake Shop 餅乾和烘焙零食、吉百利牛奶、Milka 和 Toblerone 巧克力。該公司透過直接商店送貨、公司自有和衛星倉庫、配送中心、第三方分銷商和其他設施以及獨立的銷售辦事處和代理商，為連鎖超市、批發商、超級中心、俱樂部商店、量販店、分銷商、便利商店、加油站、藥店、超值商店和其他零售食品店提供服務。該公司還透過電子零售平台、零售商數位平台以及直接面向消費者的網站和社交媒體平台直接向企業和消費者銷售產品。 Mondelez International, Inc. 前身為卡夫食品公司 (Kraft Foods Inc.)，於 2012 年 10 月更名為 Mondelez International, Inc.。該公司成立於 2000 年，總部位於伊利諾伊州芝加哥。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"糖果商","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":63.19,"h":63.23,"l":61.88,"c":61.96,"v":5851900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":61.82,"h":62.11,"l":61.46,"c":62.05,"v":8456900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":61.69,"h":61.85,"l":61.31,"c":61.76,"v":6463800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":61.76,"h":61.97,"l":61.02,"c":61.28,"v":7242500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":61.28,"h":61.65,"l":61.01,"c":61.44,"v":5866800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":61.58,"h":62.06,"l":61.2,"c":61.79,"v":7815300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":61.36,"h":61.77,"l":59.37,"c":61.3,"v":10566600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":61.4,"h":61.55,"l":60.89,"c":60.9,"v":4612500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":61.03,"h":62.51,"l":60.95,"c":61.74,"v":6149600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":61.59,"h":61.97,"l":61.0,"c":61.94,"v":6540800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":61.84,"h":62.86,"l":61.72,"c":62.57,"v":5785000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":62.29,"h":62.47,"l":61.37,"c":62.27,"v":6678900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":62.33,"h":63.2,"l":62.0,"c":62.05,"v":6423900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":61.98,"h":62.47,"l":61.69,"c":61.98,"v":4853600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":62.0,"h":62.68,"l":61.57,"c":61.6,"v":6760500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":61.62,"h":62.95,"l":61.46,"c":62.7,"v":8403200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":62.69,"